abstract: >-
  This repository contains the Python scripts and processed datasets required to reproduce Figures 1 through 4 presented in the paper "Non-local Evolution of Magnetic Helicity across the MHD-Kinetic Interface".

  To accommodate different user needs, the codebase is structured into three levels of reproducibility:
  - Level 3 (Quick Figure Reproduction, Recommended): Uses pre-extracted lightweight datasets (.csv and .h5) in plot_data/ to instantly generate Figures 1-4 via plot_figureX.py without downloading raw satellite data.
  - Level 2 (Plot Data Extraction & Calculation): Runs calculate_plot_data.py to recalculate physical quantities from intermediate .parquet/.ipc files.
  - Level 1 (Raw Data Preprocessing): Provides reference prep_stepX scripts demonstrating how raw Parker Solar Probe (PSP) L2/L3 CDF files were processed.

  Changes in this version:
  - Added the LICENSE file.
  - Added repository metadata and abstract in CITATION.cff.
